#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:2
msgid "A10 Load Balancers"
msgstr "A10 Load Balancers"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| integrates with A10 Networks Thunder and vThunder Application "
"Delivery Controllers (ADC). The integration supports automated "
"provisioning of virtual servers, service groups, and HTTP templates with "
"domain-based routing."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| integrates con A10 Redes Thunder y vThunder Aplicación "
"Delivery Controllers (ADC). El integration soporta automated provisioning"
" de virtual servidores, servicio groups, y HTTP templates con domain-"
"based routing."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:9
msgid ""
"When instances are attached to an A10 load balancer, |morpheus| "
"automatically:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando instances son adjunto un un A10 load balancer, |morpheus| "
"automáticamente:"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:11
msgid "Creates server entries for each container/VM in the instance"
msgstr "Crea servidor entradas para cada container/VM en el instance"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:12
msgid "Creates a service group with the appropriate port mappings"
msgstr "Crea un servicio group con el appropriate puerto mappings"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:13
msgid "Updates the HTTP template with host-based routing rules"
msgstr "Actualiza el HTTP template con host-based routing reglas"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:14
msgid "Configures SSL certificates (when applicable)"
msgstr "Configura SSL certificados (cuando applicable)"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:17
msgid "Adding an A10 Load Balancer"
msgstr "Adding un A10 Balanceador de carga"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:19
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Load Balancers``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Load Balancers``"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:20
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:21
msgid "Select **A10**"
msgstr "Seleccionar **A10**"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:22
msgid "Fill in the following:"
msgstr "Fill en el siguiente:"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:24
msgid "GROUP"
msgstr "GROUP"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:25
msgid "Select the Group the Load Balancer will be available for."
msgstr "Seleccionar el Grupo el Balanceador de carga será be disponible para."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:26
msgid "CLOUD"
msgstr "CLOUD"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:27
msgid "Select the Cloud the Load Balancer will be available for."
msgstr "Seleccionar el Nube el Balanceador de carga será be disponible para."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:28
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:29
msgid "Name of the Load Balancer in |morpheus|."
msgstr "Nombre del Balanceador de carga en |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:30
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:31
msgid "Identifying information displayed on the Load Balancer list page."
msgstr ""
"Identifying información mostrado en el Balanceador de carga página de "
"lista."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:32
msgid "VISIBILITY"
msgstr "VISIBILITY"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:33
msgid ""
"Define Multi-Tenant visibility. **Public** allows all Tenants to see the "
"load balancer. **Private** restricts visibility to selected Tenants."
msgstr ""
"Define Multi-Inquilino visibility. **Public** permite todos Inquilinos a "
"consulte la load balancer. **Private** restricts visibility a "
"seleccionado Inquilinos."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:34
msgid "API HOST"
msgstr "API HOST"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:35
msgid "IP address or resolvable hostname of the A10 management interface."
msgstr "IP dirección o resolvable hostname del A10 gestión interfaz."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:36
msgid "API PORT"
msgstr "API PORT"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:37
msgid "Management API port (typically ``443``)."
msgstr "Gestión API puerto (típicamente ``443``)."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:38
msgid "USERNAME"
msgstr "USERNAME"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:39
msgid "API user with administrative privileges."
msgstr "API usuario con administrative privileges."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:40
msgid "PASSWORD"
msgstr "PASSWORD"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:41
msgid "API user password."
msgstr "API usuario contraseña."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:42
msgid "INTERNAL IP"
msgstr "INTERNAL IP"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:43
msgid "The internal VIP address for the load balancer."
msgstr "El interno VIP dirección para el load balancer."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:44
msgid "PUBLIC IP"
msgstr "PUBLIC IP"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:45
msgid "The external/public IP address (if applicable)."
msgstr "El externo/público IP dirección (si corresponde)."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:46
msgid "VIP ADDRESS"
msgstr "VIP ADDRESS"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:47
msgid "The Virtual IP address for load balancing traffic."
msgstr "El Virtual IP dirección para balanceo de carga traffic."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:48
msgid "VIP PORT"
msgstr "VIP PORT"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:49
msgid "The port on which the VIP listens (e.g., ``80``, ``443``)."
msgstr "El puerto en cual el VIP listens (e.g., ``80``, ``443``)."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:51
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`GUARDAR CAMBIOS`"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:54
msgid "How A10 Integration Works"
msgstr "Cómo A10 Integración Works"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:56
msgid ""
"When an Instance is added to an A10 load balancer, |morpheus| performs "
"the following operations via the A10 aXAPI:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando un Instancia es agregado a un A10 load balancer, |morpheus| "
"performs lo siguiente operaciones via el A10 aXAPI:"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Server Creation** — For each container in the instance, a server object"
" is created on the A10 with the container's IP address."
msgstr ""
"**Servidor Creation** — Para cada container en el instance, un servidor "
"object es creado en el A10 con el container's IP dirección."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Service Group Creation** — A service group is created containing all "
"the servers and their designated ports."
msgstr ""
"**Servicio Grupo Creation** — Un servicio group es creado containing "
"todos el servidores y su designated puertos."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:60
msgid ""
"**HTTP Template Update** — The virtual server's HTTP template is updated "
"with host-based routing rules that direct traffic to the correct service "
"group based on the instance's hostname."
msgstr ""
"**HTTP Template Update** — El virtual servidor's HTTP template es "
"actualizado con host-based routing reglas ese direct traffic al correct "
"servicio group basado en el instance's hostname."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:61
msgid ""
"**SSL Configuration** — If SSL is configured for the instance, "
"certificates and keys are uploaded to the A10 and bound to the virtual "
"server port 443."
msgstr ""
"**SSL Configuración** — Si SSL está configurado para el instance, "
"certificados y claves son uploaded al A10 y bound al virtual servidor "
"puerto 443."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:64
msgid "Removing an Instance"
msgstr "Removing un Instancia"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:66
msgid ""
"When an instance is removed from the A10 load balancer, |morpheus| "
"reverses the operations:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando un instance es eliminado desde el A10 load balancer, |morpheus| "
"reverses el operaciones:"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:68
msgid "Removes host routing entries from the HTTP template"
msgstr "Removes host routing entradas desde el HTTP template"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:69
msgid "Deletes the service group"
msgstr "Deletes el servicio group"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:70
msgid "Removes individual server registrations"
msgstr "Removes individual servidor registrations"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:73
msgid "Virtual Servers"
msgstr "Virtual Servers"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:75
msgid ""
"A10 virtual servers are automatically created when the load balancer "
"integration is initialized. The virtual server is configured with:"
msgstr ""
"A10 virtual servidores son automáticamente creado cuando el load balancer"
" integration es initialized. El virtual servidor está configurado con:"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:77
msgid "The VIP address and port specified during integration setup"
msgstr "El VIP address y port specified durante integration setup"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:78
msgid "An HTTP template for host-based routing"
msgstr "Un HTTP template para host-based routing"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:79
msgid "Ports 80 and 443 with the routing template applied"
msgstr "Ports 80 y 443 con el routing template applied"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:82
msgid "SSL Certificate Management"
msgstr "SSL Certificate Management"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:84
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can automatically manage SSL certificates on A10 load "
"balancers:"
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| puede automáticamente manage SSL certificados en A10 load "
"balancers:"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:86
msgid "Certificates are uploaded as PEM files via the aXAPI"
msgstr "Certificates son uploaded como PEM archivos via el aXAPI"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:87
msgid "Private keys are uploaded separately"
msgstr "Privado claves son uploaded separadamente"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:88
msgid "Certificate bindings are applied to port 443 on the virtual server"
msgstr "Certificate bindings son applied a puerto 443 en el virtual servidor"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:89
msgid "When instances are removed, their associated certificates are cleaned up"
msgstr "Cuando instances son eliminado, su associated certificados son cleaned up"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:91
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:91
msgid ""
"The A10 integration uses the aXAPI v3 interface. Ensure the A10 device is"
" running ACOS 4.x or later for full compatibility."
msgstr ""
"El A10 integration usa el aXAPI v3 interfaz. Asegurar el A10 device está "
"en ejecución ACOS 4.x o later para completo compatibility."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:94
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solución de problemas"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:96
msgid ""
"**Connection errors** — Verify the API Host and Port are reachable from "
"the |morpheus| appliance and that the management interface is enabled."
msgstr ""
"**Conexión errors** — Verificar el API Host y Port son reachable desde el"
" |morpheus| appliance y ese el gestión interfaz está habilitado."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:97
msgid ""
"**Authentication failures** — Confirm the credentials have administrative"
" (or at minimum, read/write) API access on the A10 device."
msgstr ""
"**Autenticación failures** — Confirmar el credentials tienen "
"administrative (o en mínimo, read/write) API acceso en el A10 device."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:98
msgid ""
"**SSL upload failures** — Ensure the certificate and key are in valid PEM"
" format."
msgstr ""
"**SSL upload failures** — Asegurar el certificado y clave son en válido "
"PEM format."

